## Undo.cpp/a step of several changes
a removed, then b renamed to a -> done; then [a=2]; undo done; then [a=1, b=2]; redo done; then [a=2]
a renamed to b, then a saved anew -> done; then [a=new, b=1]; undo done; then [a=1]; redo done; then [a=new, b=1]
a saved twice -> done; then [a=3]; undo done; then [a=1]; redo done; then [a=3]
d made, d/x saved, then renamed to d/y -> done; then [d/, d/y=1]; undo done; then []; redo done; then [d/, d/y=1]
d made, then a copied into it -> done; then [a=1, d/, d/a=1]; undo done; then [a=1]; redo done; then [a=1, d/, d/a=1]
d made, then d/x saved in it, as node new makes a node -> done; then [d/, d/x=1]; undo done; then []; redo done; then [d/, d/x=1]
d renamed to e, then e/x saved -> done; then [e/, e/x=2]; undo done; then [d/, d/x=1]; redo done; then [e/, e/x=2]
